                </EditForm>

                <div class="text-center mt-4 pt-3 border-top border-secondary">
                    <span class="text-muted">Reeds 'n rekening op MikPunt? </span>
                    <a href="/teken-in" class="fw-bold text-gold ms-1 text-decoration-none">Teken In Hier</a>
